   PortUnificationServerHandler example of Netty
   (example/src/main/java/io/netty/example/portunification/PortUnificationServerHandler.java
   at tag netty-4.2.18.Final of https://github.com/netty/netty). The header comment of the
   harness lists what differs from the example.

   The example file reads "Copyright 2012 The Netty Project", and Netty's NOTICE.txt at that
   tag reads "Copyright 2014 The Netty Project". Netty is licensed under the Apache License,
   Version 2.0. Netty's NOTICE.txt refers to the licences of the components that Netty depends
   on; none of them is part of this repository.

